				648,
				2
			],
			"Message": "feat(Cocoon): Add codegen entry point and public exports\n\nAdd the runnable CLI entry point (`Codegen.ts`) that invokes the extension-host codegen pipeline, and the public module surface (`index.ts`) re-exporting all types and functions.\n\n`Codegen.ts` is invoked by Cocoon's `prepublishOnly.sh` build hook. It resolves source/output paths from `process.cwd()` (Cocoon's package root) pointing to the VS Code editor source tree and the Cocoon output directory respectively. It handles exit codes: non-zero for internal failures, exit code 2 for codegen failures, and exits cleanly on success with a summary of records emitted and duration.\n\n`index.ts` exports the full public API including:\n- `RunExtHostCodegen` orchestrator and its options/summary types\n- `IterateExtHostDecorators` async iterator and `IsExtHostFile` predicate\n- `EmitExtHostSchema` emitter with its options/outcome types\n- `ExtHostDecoratorRecord` type\n\nThis completes the codegen infrastructure added in the previous commit, making it callable from the build system.",
			"SHA": "537d7bfd6b1caa68baa0f0b62cebb5346acdeb6a"
		}
